# .dockerignore


# Filesystem
**/.DS_Store


# Build and Dependency Artifacts (highest priority)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/obj
**/.cache
# Prisma client is generated inside the image - never copy a host build over it
**/server/config/generated
**/.next
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/*.*proj.user
**/npm-debug.log

# Docker and Compose Files
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml
**/Dockerfile*

# Github files
**/.github
**/.gitattributes

# ESLint files
**/.eslintrc.cjs
**/eslint.config.*

## Swagger file
**/swagger.yaml

# Environment and Configuration Files
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.example
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml

# Version Control Files
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE and Editor Configurations
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode

# Charts and Deployment Files
**/charts

# Tests and Results
**/tests
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/*.spec.*

# Seed script - dev-only demo data with a known password, never shipped
prisma/seed.js

# Documentation, licenses and agent instructions
README*
LICENSE
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

